{
  "actor": "/root/next_primary59",
  "status": "BOUNDED_SOURCE_API_SCOUT_COMPLETE",
  "named_source_scout_payload": {
    "contract": {
      "actor": "/root/next_primary59",
      "status": "SOURCE_API_DIAGNOSIS_ONLY_NOT_A_SOURCE_REVIEW_VERDICT",
      "source_required_objects": {
        "all_macro_root": "Gamma_P=(I-U_PP^2)^(1/2), unique nonnegative bounded real Hilbert root on ALL H_P, no eta coefficient. Under actual canonical isometric macro identification this is Gamma=sqrt(D), D=I-T^2 on ALL real L2(nu).",
        "B11_consumer": "For every real u, norm(Gamma u)=norm(B M u) with B=(I-P)UP; Gamma^2=D and selfadjointness imply norm(Gamma u)^2=inner(Du,u)=norm(u)^2-norm(Tu)^2, while actual55 gives the same norm(BMu)^2.",
        "centered_inverse_polar": "H0 is actual whole closed kernel of inner(q), not finite/dense substitute. Gamma0 is true restriction; Gamma0^2=D0, source B15 needs Gamma0>=2sqrt(alphaeta)/(1+alphaeta)I. IsUnit Gamma0 and B*Gamma0^-1 isometry give B16 on centered macro only. Full D killsq so no full inverse."
      },
      "one_minimal_next_delta": {
        "proposed_target": "Positive real L2 bounded-operator complex lift with exact real embedding action and conjugation compatibility; actual59 positive D is the consumer.",
        "result_kind_if_eventually_compiled": "reusable-interface plus actual PBPS instantiation",
        "suggested_home": "AutoSamplingTheory/TechnicalLemmas/Measure/L2RealComplexOperator.lean (new proposal only, not created)",
        "suggested_name": "exists_positive_complex_lift",
        "background_inputs": "Measurable space, actual measure nu, D:Lp real2nu ->L[real] same, D.IsPositive. No probability/finite measure/finite-dimensional L2/Nontrivial/CFC premise; L2 completeness from real/complex complete scalar codomain.",
        "conclusion": "Produce Dc:Lp complex2nu ->L[complex] same, Dc.IsPositive, and iota∘D=Dc∘iota; pointwise conjugation C commutes with Dc as real maps. iota is actual ofReal L2 embedding, and real fixed subspace is exactly range(iota).",
        "actual_consumer": "Under original PBPS E,V,alpha,beta,eta binders obtain actual59 T/q/D positive and instantiate this lift. Test-only D0 coercivity/unit remains separate; do not import Tests into production or add its coercivity as caller premise.",
        "acceptance_boundary": "This lift target has not been compiled or independently validated. Old raw real-complex candidate is not admitted. Root/uniqueness/real fixed-subspace descent still require further proof after this minimal interface."
      },
      "available_genuine_real_APIs": [
        "ContinuousLinearMap.compLp, compLpL, coeFn_compLpL: scalar real continuous maps lift to actual Lp; p2 satisfies Fact(1<=p).",
        "Complex.reCLM, Complex.imCLM, Complex.ofRealCLM, Complex.conjCLE as REAL linear scalar maps. Lift by compLpL to real/imag/embedding/conjugation on same measure.",
        "MeasureTheory.memLp_re_im_iff and MemLp.ofReal; L2.inner_def and integrable_inner for real/complex L2 products; actual AE class decomposition by Lp.ext.",
        "ContinuousLinearMap.spectralRadius_eq_nnnorm [RCLike] [CompleteSpace], Rayleigh182, already proves real case. TODO180 is proof replacement, not missing theorem.",
        "ContinuousLinearMap.IsPositive.spectrumRestricts and NonnegSpectrumClass real in StarOrder35/51 available before real CFC-dependent StarOrderedRing."
      ],
      "complex_CFC_after_lift_only": [
        "CStarAlgebra (H ->L[complex] H) for complete complex Hilbert H, ContinuousLinearMap.lean22.",
        "IsSelfAdjoint.instContinuousFunctionalCalculus real from existing complex calculus, Instances234; scalar of calculus real does NOT mean operator space is real Hilbert.",
        "CFC.sqrt_nonneg, sqrt_mul_sqrt_self, sqrt_unique in Rpow/Basic239/265/283 after StarOrderedRing and nonunital real CFC instances.",
        "CFC.monotone_sqrt/ sqrt_le_sqrt in Rpow/Order78/89 assume complex NonUnitalCStarAlgebra; usable on complex lift to transfer B15 only after descent/order adapter.",
        "CFC.isUnit_sqrt_iff Basic722 available only after CFC requirements; no direct real-unit/root completion."
      ],
      "hidden_hypotheses": [
        "Dc formula = iota(D(Re f))+I*iota(D(Im f)); must establish complex-linearity, boundedness and full complex selfadjoint/positive quadratic form, not just real-coordinate boundedness.",
        "Complex root R=sqrt(Dc) must preserve C-fixed real subspace. Operator adjoint selfadjointness does NOT establish pointwise complex conjugation invariance. One valid planned argument conjugates R, proves resulting complex operator positive with square Dc, then invokes sqrt_unique. This argument is uncompiled.",
        "iota/re descent must be representative-safe and actual isometric L2 embedding, with induced operator bounded and real positive; complex L2 and original real L2 are different spaces, not automatically defeq.",
        "Constants: Dq=0 leads norm(Gammaq)^2=0, then Gamma preserves H0 by selfadjointness. Restriction square must be D0 on SAME H0; arbitrary new centered subspace not allowed.",
        "Rank0/subsingleton kept; no nonempty spectrum proof relying on Nontrivial can be introduced as public binder. alphaeta1 keeps rho0/delta1, T0zero/D0identity, Gamma0identity; whole-space T still fixes constants."
      ],
      "false_or_circular_paths": [
        "Calling CFC.sqrt directly on real Hilbert CLM via instStarOrderedRingRCLike is circular: lemma assumes missing real ContinuousFunctionalCalculus and comments only complex instance currently available.",
        "Finite-dimensional E does not make real L2 finite-dimensional; eigenbasis/matrix root substitute invalid.",
        "CFC cfc_star is operator star/adjoint compatibility, not pointwise-conjugation-fixed real subspace preservation.",
        "Rayleigh spectral radius alone plus real Weierstrass is insufficient as a ready root API: existing generic polynomial spectral mapping equality requires IsAlgClosed; over real only image subset is available and points the wrong way for an immediate norm upper bound. A new selfadjoint real polynomial norm-calculus theorem would still be needed.",
        "Existing binomialSeries operator-algebra definition does not give ready root proof: supplied radius>=1 theorem assumes NormedDivisionRing for the evaluated algebra; bounded operators are not a division ring. Full ||T||=1 on constant class is boundary, so strict open-ball convergence at -T^2 cannot be assumed. Centered ||T0||<1 may help a separate series route but does not provide B10 all-macro root.",
        "IsUnit D0 is not Gamma itself or B15 Loewner-root gap. After Gamma0^2=D0, unit of Gamma0 follows by injectivity/surjectivity of its square; do not use isUnit_of_mul_isUnit_left/right which have IsDedekindFiniteMonoid assumptions (not available generically for infinite-dimensional operator ring).",
        "Do not replace true Gamma with gradient/Laplacian/resolvent root or add eta prefactor."
      ],
      "blueprint_max_seven_steps": [
        "Build actual iota/re/im/conjugation L2 maps from genuine real compLpL and AE decomposition.",
        "Construct bounded complex-linear Dc from D on the two real components; prove exact intertwining and conjugation commutation.",
        "Prove complex selfadjointness/positivity using L2 inner integration and two real positive quadratic forms; instantiate with actual59 D under original source binders. This is the recommended minimal next delta boundary.",
        "Later use existing complex CFC positive root; conjugate it and apply root uniqueness to prove invariance of the real fixed subspace.",
        "Descend to bounded real positive Gamma with Gamma^2=D and uniqueness; consume actual55 squared microscopic defect to establish B11 norm identity.",
        "Derive Gammaq=0, true H0 restriction Gamma0 and square D0; real Test combines actual59 D0 unit/coercivity for centered inverse and exact B15 order transfer when adapter is proved.",
        "Build polar map B composed with inverse Gamma0 into microscopic kernel and prove isometry from B11; do not claim this before root/domain/intertwining contracts compile."
      ],
      "remaining_boundary": "No theorem/SAU/Goal/source-review transition. Genuine allmacro real positive root/descent/uniqueness and B11 are unproved. Centered root order/inverse/polar, weakH1, C5-C7/halfturn/dynamics/nonexplosion/hypocoercivity/main/errors/cost/composition all remain separate. Current59 actual theorem awaiting parent verification/integration; no new science status asserted.",
      "inspection_limitations": "Initial handoff Get-Content -Raw output truncated; subsequently frozen only current leading handoff context. Incidental old handoff output not used to schedule old targets. Three nonexistent wildcard/file-path rg probes retained as command negatives; fixed paths re-inspected. No claim exhaustive absence across all Mathlib/ASTIS."
    },
